OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners try to save
OL,4,ABeckenham's Art Deco Odeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners are fighting to save a
OL,7,Fcentury-old cinema in south-east London
OL,8,Fafter its operator announced it would
OL,9,Fclose at the end of November.
OL,11,FThe Odeon on the high street in
OL,12,FBeckenham said it had entered "a
OL,13,Fvoluntary commercial agreement with its
OL,14,Flandlord" and would stop operating from
OL,15,Fthe Grade II-listed building.
OL,17,FThe site is owned by Citygate Church,
OL,18,Fwhich wants to turn it into a place of
OL,19,Fworship and community space while
OL,20,Frestoring some of its Art Deco
OL,21,Ffeatures.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
