OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners try to save
OL,4,ABeckenham's Art Deco Odeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Save Our Screen group wants it to
OL,7,Fremain a cinema, with some residents
OL,8,Fdescribing the closure as a blow to the
OL,9,Fcommunity.
